- `src/ratelimit/rate_policy.py` — new `RatePolicy` class (block_threshold, block_duration, blocked_until).
- `tests/test_limiter.py` — unit tests for stats and policy.
- `tests/test_rate_policy.py` — new integration tests for policy + stats interaction.

## Tests to add
